ΔP is a direct measurement, not a fitted classifier, so it is not
subject to the probe's overfitting critique.

--- PAIRED T-TEST ---
t = 22.3484
p = 0.000000
Cohen's d = 2.2809
Significant (α=0.01): True
Interpretation: LARGE effect: refusal direction is STRONGLY reduced in agent format

--- PERMUTATION TEST ---
Observed ΔP = 402.7195
Empirical p = 0.000000
Null 95% CI: [-88.8566, 87.0642]
Significant: True

--- BENIGN CONTROL (difference-in-differences) ---
