ΔP benign  (control) : -1.1376   p = 0.527832
Interaction          : +403.8571   p = 0.000100
Share of the harmful shift also seen on benign prompts: -0.3%
Only the interaction is specific to refusal. The rest is what
moving from chat to agent does to EVERY prompt.

